Subject: [PATCH] r48 control: launch capped scopes directly without cap-run
 ancestor

---
 scripts/ctl-direct-systemd.mjs | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 scripts/round-gate.mjs         |  6 ++++--
 scripts/surface-probe.mjs      | 15 +++++++++------
 3 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
